@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Submit a valid General ticket (admin key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot connect to database",
  "description": "Getting timeout errors on production server",
  "priority": 2,
  "category": 0,
  "requestedBy": "dev@example.com",
  "apiKey": "key-admin-001"
}

###

### Submit a Technical ticket with user key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build pipeline failing",
  "description": "CI is broken since last push",
  "priority": 1,
  "category": 1,
  "requestedBy": "ci@example.com",
  "apiKey": "key-user-002"
}

###

### Submit a Security ticket with admin key (allowed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Suspicious login activity detected",
  "description": "Multiple failed login attempts from unknown IP",
  "priority": 3,
  "category": 3,
  "requestedBy": "security@example.com",
  "apiKey": "key-admin-001"
}

###

### REJECT — Spam keyword in title
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "You are a winner — claim your prize now",
  "description": "Click here to get free stuff",
  "priority": 0,
  "category": 0,
  "requestedBy": "spammer@example.com",
  "apiKey": "key-admin-001"
}

###

### REJECT — Invalid API key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Need help with my account",
  "description": "I cannot log in",
  "priority": 1,
  "category": 0,
  "requestedBy": "user@example.com",
  "apiKey": "invalid-key-xyz"
}

###

### REJECT — Authorization: support key cannot submit Security tickets
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Potential data breach",
  "description": "Suspicious query logs found",
  "priority": 3,
  "category": 3,
  "requestedBy": "support@example.com",
  "apiKey": "key-support-003"
}

###

### REJECT — Missing API key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Help needed",
  "description": "Something is wrong",
  "priority": 0,
  "category": 0,
  "requestedBy": "anonymous@example.com"
}
